= Faster, Stronger, Betterer

#html.img(src: "/assets/starlog-placeholder-18.jpg", alt: "Nebulous 1.8 release artwork")

We're back with updates that make Nebulous quicker and easier to use.

== New Features & Enhancements

- *NebulaProtect Supercharged:* Real-time monitoring keeps your work secure.
- *NebulaConnect for Teams:* Collaboration now includes project tracking.
- *Speed Boost Galore:* Common tasks respond more quickly.

== Bug Fixes

- Resolved crashes in NebulaSync.
- Fixed rare data hiccups during file transfers.
- Improved support for older devices.
